 Report any concerns directly to Miguel Garcia at ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"info@greenpointms.com"}]," or ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"347-332-9348"}],". Reports will be investigated promptly and confidentially. Retaliation for a good-faith report is itself a violation of this policy and is illegal under New York law."]}]}],["$","style",null,{"children":"\n        #section-14 p { margin: 0 0 14px 0; }\n        #section-14 p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n        #section-14 ul { margin: 0 0 14px 0; padding-left: 0; list-style: none; }\n        #section-14 ol { margin: 0 0 14px 0; }\n      "}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"marginBottom":36,"scrollMarginTop":100},"id":"section-15","children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif","fontSize":22,"fontWeight":700,"color":"#0d2818","marginBottom":14,"display":"flex","alignItems":"baseline","gap":12,"flexWrap":"wrap"},"children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"'JetBrains Mono', monospace","fontSize":13,"color":"#1B7A3D","fontWeight":700,"letterSpacing":"0.05em"},"children":["§","15"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Weather & Environmental Hazards"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":15,"color":"#444","lineHeight":1.8},"children":["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","0",{"style":{"paddingLeft":28,"paddingBottom":10,"position":"relative","fontSize":15,"color":"#444","lineHeight":1.7},"children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"position":"absolute","left":0,"top":2,"width":18,"height":18,"borderRadius":"50%","background":"rgba(27,122,61,0.1)","color":"#1B7A3D","fontSize":11,"fontWeight":700,"display":"flex","alignItems":"center","justifyContent":"center","fontFamily":"'JetBrains Mono', monospace"},"children":"✓"}],"In extreme heat, take more frequent water breaks and rest in shaded or air-conditioned areas. Report signs of heat exhaustion or heat stroke immediately."]}],["$","li","1",{"style":{"paddingLeft":28,"paddingBottom":10,"position":"relativ